        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 894813,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894814,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Hi Shannon - how are you settling into your new flat?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 96.814995,
                  "from": 93.17,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894826,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894827,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Really well, thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 98.494995,
                  "from": 96.975,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894831,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894832,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: You look like you’re going shopping.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.494995,
                  "from": 98.575,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894839,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894840,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Yes, I am.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 102.174995,
                  "from": 100.494995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 894844,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My cousins are coming to stay for a couple of days, and I have to cook for them.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 107.135,
                  "from": 102.494995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894862,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894863,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Well, there are plenty of places to buy food in Kite Place - it’s the area by the harbour.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.53999,
                  "from": 107.215,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894882,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894883,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Oh, OK, I’ll find that on the map.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 117.85999,
                  "from": 114.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 894892,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 98.494995,
                  "from": 97.935,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894894,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894895,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: What sort of food do you need to get?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 121.14,
                  "from": 118.899994,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894905,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894906,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Well, neither of them eats meat but they both like fish.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.585,
                  "from": 121.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894919,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894920,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Well, there’s a really good fish market there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.785,
                  "from": 125.905,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894927,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894928,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Oh great - where is it exactly?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 131.66501,
                  "from": 128.785,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894935,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894936,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: It’s at the far end of Kite Place, so you have to go over the bridge and then it’s on the right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 139.22002,
                  "from": 131.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894959,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894960,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: OK - is it open all day?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 142.50002,
                  "from": 139.78001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894967,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894968,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: It doesn’t close until four, but I’d recommend going earlier than that - it does run out of some things.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 150.365,
                  "from": 142.82,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894988,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894989,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Oh, I don’t want that to happen.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 152.365,
                  "from": 150.365,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 894997,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 894998,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: As long as you get there by 3.30, you should be fine.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 156.845,
                  "from": 152.685,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895011,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s only 11 now, so plenty of time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 159.885,
                  "from": 157.325,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895021,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895022,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.60501,
                  "from": 159.885,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895024,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895025,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Do you need to buy vegetables too?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 163.245,
                  "from": 161.165,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895034,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895035,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: I do, and I want to avoid all the plastic packaging in the supermarket!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 168.41,
                  "from": 163.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895050,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895051,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Well, there’s a really nice organic shop there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 171.85,
                  "from": 168.56999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895059,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now what’s it called ... it’s the name of a flower.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 176.01,
                  "from": 172.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895069,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know, it’s ’Rose’.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 178.625,
                  "from": 176.945,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895074,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895075,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: That’s a nice name.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 180.145,
                  "from": 178.945,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895079,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895080,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Yeah - it sells vegetables and quite a lot of other stuff.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 184.225,
                  "from": 180.145,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895092,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895093,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: And where’s that?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 185.34502,
                  "from": 184.225,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895097,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895098,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Well, as you reach the market, you’ll see a big grey building on your left - I think it used to be a warehouse.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 192.96,
                  "from": 185.585,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895120,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Anyway, now it’s a restaurant upstairs, but the ground floor has two shops either side of the entrance and it’s the one on the left.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 203.12,
                  "from": 193.28,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895145,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895146,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: That’s easy enough.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 204.72,
                  "from": 203.12,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895150,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895151,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: You can’t miss it - there’s also a big sign on the pavement so you can look for that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 211.285,
                  "from": 204.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895169,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895170,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Fine!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 212.24501,
                  "from": 211.605,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895173,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I guess if I need anything else, I’ll have to go to the supermarket.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 217.12502,
                  "from": 213.045,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895188,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895189,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Yeah - you should be able to get everything you need, but there’s a minibus that goes to the supermarket if you need it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 225.40001,
                  "from": 217.205,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895212,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s purple and the number is 289.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 229.48001,
                  "from": 225.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895220,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895221,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Thanks, that’s great.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 231.4,
                  "from": 229.64,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895225,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895226,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: So what do you need to get at the fish market?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 271.475,
                  "from": 268.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895239,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The salmon is always very good and the shellfish.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 275.07498,
                  "from": 271.63498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895249,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895250,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: I’m going to make a curry, I think, and I need about 12 prawns for that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 281.02,
                  "from": 275.65997,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895266,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895267,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: They’ll have plenty of those.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 282.62,
                  "from": 281.09998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895274,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895275,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: OK.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.58002,
                  "from": 139.78001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895277,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895278,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Have you ever tried samphire?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 285.97998,
                  "from": 283.81998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895286,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895287,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: No - what’s that?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 287.58,
                  "from": 286.37997,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895293,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895294,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: It’s a type of seaweed.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 290.115,
                  "from": 288.115,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895300,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I just ask for a handful and you fry it in butter.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 294.915,
                  "from": 290.91498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895312,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s delicious!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 295.955,
                  "from": 294.995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895315,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895316,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Oh, I might try that - how do you spell it?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 299.955,
                  "from": 295.955,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895327,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895328,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: It’s S-A-M-P-H-I-R-E.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 309.64,
                  "from": 300.03497,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895345,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895346,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Great - it’s always good to try something different.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 313.0,
                  "from": 309.64,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895356,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895357,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Yeah.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 180.865,
                  "from": 180.145,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895359,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895360,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: I’ll see what beans they have in the organic shop and I think I’ll get something for dessert there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 321.035,
                  "from": 314.36,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895380,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895381,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: How about a mango?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.19498,
                  "from": 321.19498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895386,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895387,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: I’m not sure - they’re not always ripe.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 327.035,
                  "from": 323.19498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895395,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d prefer a melon - it’s bigger too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 330.075,
                  "from": 327.19498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895402,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895403,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: Good idea.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 330.875,
                  "from": 330.235,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895406,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The owner also sells a lot of spices there that you can put in a curry, and things like coconut.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 339.69,
                  "from": 331.85,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895425,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895426,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Oh, that’s very helpful.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 341.61002,
                  "from": 339.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895431,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ll have a look.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 342.97,
                  "from": 341.85,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895436,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895437,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: No problem.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 343.77,
                  "from": 342.97,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895440,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895441,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: I know bread doesn’t really go with curry but I always like to have some in case.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 350.13498,
                  "from": 344.29498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895459,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895460,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "LEON: As I said - all the bread is home-made and there’s lots of variety.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 352.535,
                  "from": 350.13498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895474,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I like the brown bread myself.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 357.895,
                  "from": 355.895,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895481,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895482,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SHANNON: Mm, sounds good.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 359.25,
                  "from": 357.98,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895486,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895487,
                "level": 2,
